  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Disaster Risk Management in Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the Disister Risk Management Units national strategy and develop an efficient and replicable river basin integrated risk management model allowing local communities and actors to build their resilience and enhance their means and capacity to engage in prevention, preparedness and response against disasters, with a particular focus on floods in two river basins.</narrative>
  </description>
